# GitHub baton

- `GITHUB_BATON` is a documented future input route until authorized.
- Trust anchor is out-of-band `expected_contract_sha256`, never Issue text alone.
- Project Chat Pro remains the control plane on that route.
- Cursor executes only the exact Atom Contract after preflight.
- Material contract changes require a new revision and hash.
- Bounded GitHub reads require explicit authority for one exact Issue view.
- No GitHub writes or unbounded/discovery reads unless a later atom grants that class.
- Protocol: `docs/agent/GITHUB_BATON_PROTOCOL.md`.
- Tooling: `scripts/baton_preflight.py` and `.cursor/commands/baton-preflight.md`.
